WEBVTT

00:06:57.578 --> 00:07:01.125
the most successful businesses
in this country, the unicorns,

00:07:01.149 --> 00:07:05.101
are built by people who came
as foreign students or as immigrants,

00:07:05.125 --> 00:07:07.895
and they're the founders
or the cofounders.

00:07:07.919 --> 00:07:10.680
Well, here's what's happened
over the last three years

00:07:10.704 --> 00:07:12.760
to the best brains in the world.

00:07:12.784 --> 00:07:15.093
Forty-two percent of them
did not get visas

00:07:15.117 --> 00:07:17.045
or chose not to get visas.

00:07:17.411 --> 00:07:19.903
This is how you wipe out an economy.

00:07:19.927 --> 00:07:22.193
This isn't about kids and borders.

00:07:22.863 --> 00:07:24.013
It's about us.

00:07:25.696 --> 00:07:28.481
This is about who we are,
who we the people are,

00:07:29.387 --> 00:07:31.453
as a nation and as individuals.